# OpenAPI rules

`api/openapi.yaml` is the only HTTP contract source. Generate Go transport code
with ogen and the TypeScript Fetch client with Hey API. Commit generated files
and enforce zero drift. Handwritten code uses explicit domain mappers.

Snapshot is the only durable current-interaction and reconciliation read model.
Archive pages continue immutable history without exposing another Agent state
model. Contract tests must enforce the complete supported HTTP path set.
